---
import Card from "./Card/index.astro";
import Pulse from "./Pulse.astro";
---
<Card colSpan="lg:col-start-4" rowSpan="lg:row-start-10 lg:row-span-5">
  <div class="flex justify-between w-full items-start mb-2">
    <div class="flex flex-col">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold m-0">Now</h2>
      <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">
        Updated October 2026 ·
        <a class="cursor-pointer" href="https://sive.rs/now" target="_blank">what's that?</a>
      </span>
    </div>
    <Pulse />
  </div>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <p class="text-sm font-light"><b class="font-semibold">At work:</b> getting my dev team comfortable using AI on real tasks, within the guardrails a semiconductor fab requires.</p>
    <p class="text-sm font-light"><b class="font-semibold">On the side:</b> my personal lab. A 2016 MacBook now runs as an always-on Claude Code agent and briefs me on the chip industry every weekday at 7:30. My notes live in a personal knowledge system on Obsidian.</p>
    <p class="text-sm font-light"><b class="font-semibold">Off the clock:</b> strength training and eating clean. Stay strong, stay healthy.</p>
  </div>
</Card>
